{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">石澳有男子被狗咬傷右腳送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">55歲傷者由救護車送往東區醫院治理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事主報稱早上近九時，踩單車經過石澳村停車場時，突然被一隻約一米長的狗咬其右腳。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DOG.SHEKO-1630_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026WBYwEoR4YG1787043730.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DOG.SHEKO-1630_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當時狗有狗繩並由外傭拖著。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方將案件列作「狗隻咬噬」，交漁護署跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T09:19:51.594255+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}